{"repositoryId":1095098237,"availability":"available","full":"aksheyw/GrowFlowAI","name":"GrowFlowAI","description":"AI task-management companion. Meeting notes become tasks that grow like plants. Telegram + Web + Android.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2025-11-12T15:34:13Z","updated":"2026-10-17T22:19:13Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://grow-flow-ai.vercel.app","topics":["ai","android","automation","capacitor","gamification","meeting-notes","n8n","productivity","pwa","react","supabase","tailwindcss","task-management","telegram-bot","typescript"],"demo":"https://grow-flow-ai.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T11:32:06.427Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T11:32:06.427Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T11:32:06.427Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-18T11:32:06.427Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Your meeting notes, turned into tasks that grow like plants.","Most of what I agreed to in meetings used to get lost in notes I never re-read, so I built GrowFlowAI. You send it a meeting note (typed, a voice memo or a whiteboard photo) from the web app, email or Telegram (a chat app), and AI pulls out WHO does WHAT by WHEN and saves each one as a task, which is a plant that grows as you finish it. At 9am the Telegram bot sends what's due.","The dashboard. Each task grows as you make progress on it."],"features":["A dashboard of tasks, each rendered as a plant whose growth stage tracks status (Not Started → In Progress → Done)","A meeting note detail page with related tasks and, on request, an exec-style leadership brief (TL;DR + decisions + action items in email/chat/document formats)","\"The Gardener\": ask questions about your past notes","Daily 9am Telegram digest of due/overdue tasks with one-tap ✅ Done / ⏰ Snooze / 📅 Tomorrow buttons","Google Calendar sync (tasks → calendar events)"],"sourceUrl":"https://gi